{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/Steam-Feature-Logo.png?t=1751126603\" /></div>A third-person survival horror game. The story follows a girl with psychic power who tries to escape a secret laboratory swarming with grotesque and monstrous creatures. Uncover the truth behind the incident and embark on a thrilling adventure that'll keep you on the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a sci-fi setting filled with mystery and danger, where a terror is waiting to attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/Steam-Feature-2.png?t=1751126603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/Steam_Store_image_-_3.png?t=1751126603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Elixia, a mysterious girl with unique psychic powers useful in combat and puzzle-solving. Wield a variety of psychic abilities to survive and overcome challenges. Unleash a forceful blast with the power of a bullet, use telekinesis to manipulate and hurl objects at high speed, cause enemies to implode under immense pressure, and create barriers to block and counter attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/Steam-Feature-3.png?t=1751126603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/Steam_Store_image_-_2.png?t=1751126603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against dreadful stalkers\u2014twisted creations born from sinister experiments. These relentless creatures possess unique abilities, making them formidable foes who will stop at nothing to hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/Steam-Feature-1.png?t=1751126603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/Steam_Store_image_-_1.png?t=1751126603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a fresh take on survival horror that blends classic mechanics like limited resources, backtracking, and puzzle-solving with a dynamic environment, allowing you to adapt and respond to any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your own path to survival\u2014whether through intense combat or stealthy evasion. Navigate and interact with a mysterious sci-fi laboratory, exploring freely as you uncover its dangers and secrets.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3018390?t=1751126603","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/c7262a83881f0620bd2f4a299e1a712af822cac9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751126603","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/564f588600f16570d0f405a5249b978a3d257f41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751126603","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/564f588600f16570d0f405a5249b978a3d257f41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751126603","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist Now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you interested and want to support us, Don't forget to wishlist and follow!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/Wishlist_Banner.png?t=1751126603\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/Steam-Feature-Logo.png?t=1751126603\" /></div>A third-person survival horror game. The story follows a girl with psychic power who tries to escape a secret laboratory swarming with grotesque and monstrous creatures. Uncover the truth behind the incident and embark on a thrilling adventure that'll keep you on the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a sci-fi setting filled with mystery and danger, where a terror is waiting to attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/Steam-Feature-2.png?t=1751126603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/Steam_Store_image_-_3.png?t=1751126603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Elixia, a mysterious girl with unique psychic powers useful in combat and puzzle-solving. Wield a variety of psychic abilities to survive and overcome challenges. Unleash a forceful blast with the power of a bullet, use telekinesis to manipulate and hurl objects at high speed, cause enemies to implode under immense pressure, and create barriers to block and counter attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/Steam-Feature-3.png?t=1751126603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/Steam_Store_image_-_2.png?t=1751126603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against dreadful stalkers\u2014twisted creations born from sinister experiments. These relentless creatures possess unique abilities, making them formidable foes who will stop at nothing to hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/Steam-Feature-1.png?t=1751126603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/Steam_Store_image_-_1.png?t=1751126603\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a fresh take on survival horror that blends classic mechanics like limited resources, backtracking, and puzzle-solving with a dynamic environment, allowing you to adapt and respond to any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your own path to survival\u2014whether through intense combat or stealthy evasion. Navigate and interact with a mysterious sci-fi laboratory, exploring freely as you uncover its dangers and secrets.</p>","developers":["MOON CATALYST CO., LTD."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/ad756bca9e968c3092028a6d97a667eb4d62fc16/header.jpg?t=1751126603","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9MOON CATALYST CO., LTD. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<